@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@apiKey = change-this-local-development-key

### Restaurants
GET {{base}}/restaurants

### Restaurant details
GET {{base}}/restaurants/1

### Restaurant menu
GET {{base}}/restaurants/1/dishes

### Dishes
GET {{base}}/dishes

### One dish
GET {{base}}/dishes/1

### Orders
GET {{base}}/orders
x-request-id: day60-order-list-001

### Order details
GET {{base}}/orders/1

### Create order (valid example; 201 + Location)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-request-id: day60-create-001

{
  "customerName": "Beza",
  "area": "Bole",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "lines": [{"dishId": 1, "quantity": 1}]
}

### Update status
PATCH {{base}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"preparing"}

### Staff-only endpoint
GET {{base}}/orders/staff-only
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Delete order (staff only)
DELETE {{base}}/orders/3
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Prove redaction: token, api key, and phone must not appear raw in logs
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer SECRET_TOKEN_SHOULD_NOT_APPEAR
x-api-key: SECRET_API_KEY_SHOULD_NOT_APPEAR
x-request-id: redaction-proof-001

{
  "customerName": "Redaction Test",
  "area": "Bole",
  "phone": "0999999999",
  "lines": [{"dishId": 1, "quantity": 1}]
}

### Timeout demo (takes 6 seconds; expected HTTP 408)
GET {{base}}/orders/slow
